| `useSWR(key, fetcher, config)` | `useSWRInfinite(getKey, fetcher, config)` |
| Conditional key: `userId ? url : null` | Conditional in `getKey`: `if (!userId \|\| !conversationId) return null` |
| `fallbackData: data` | `fallbackData: initialPage ? [initialPage] : undefined` |
