| `refresh` / `forceRefresh` | `mutate` (you can add the same wrappers if you want) |
| No pagination | `loadMore` + `hasMore` + `isLoadingMore` |

The **only** structural difference is `useSWR` → `useSWRInfinite` + the `getKey` function that threads cursors. Everything else — config philosophy, conditional fetching, error handling, the return shape — is your pattern.

